<title>CANADA: Canada real return bond yields median 4.060 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada real return bond yields median 4.060 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said its C$500 million auction of 4.25 percent real return bonds due December 1, 2026 produced the following results:</p>
<p>			YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>    Allotment     4.110	 102.384</p>
<p>    Median	  4.060	   N/A</p>
<p>    Low	     3.999	   N/A  Allotment ratio 52.79748</p>
<p>The bonds will be delivered on March 12. The outstanding debt of the issue totals C$2.35 billion. Bids from primary dealers totalled C$1,065.20 million, including C$27 million non-competitive tenders at the allotment yield.</p>
<p>((-- Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
